{"id":28570,"slug":"my-darling-clementine","title":"My Darling Clementine","year":1946,"country":"United States","duration":97,"spine":732,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28570-my-darling-clementine","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/382b3bdf34ee6057403e947817456b38/I8Z5Bln46SVpTSdqJB4E1ChE1CutI2_large.jpg","description":"John Ford takes on the legend of the O.K. Corral shoot-out in this multilayered, exceptionally well-constructed western, one of the director’s very best films. Henry Fonda cuts an iconic figure as Wyatt Earp, the sturdy lawman who sets about the task of shaping up the disorderly Arizona town of Tombstone, and Victor Mature gives the performance of his career as the boozy, tubercular gambler and gunman Doc Holliday. Though initially at cross-purposes, the pair ultimately team up to confront the violent Clanton gang. Affecting and stunningly photographed, My Darling Clementine is a story of the triumph of civilization over the Wild West from American cinema’s consummate mythmaker.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"John Ford","slug":"john-ford"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Henry Fonda","role":"Wyatt Earp","slug":"henry-fonda"},{"actor":"Linda Darnell","role":"Chihuahua","slug":"linda-darnell"},{"actor":"Victor Mature","role":"Doc Holliday","slug":"victor-mature"},{"actor":"Cathy Downs","role":"Clementine Carter","slug":"cathy-downs"},{"actor":"Walter Brennan","role":"Old Man Clanton","slug":"walter-brennan"},{"actor":"Tim Holt","role":"Virgil Earp","slug":"tim-holt"},{"actor":"Ward Bond","role":"Morgan Earp","slug":"ward-bond"},{"actor":"Alan Mowbray","role":"Granville Thorndyke","slug":"alan-mowbray"},{"actor":"John Ireland","role":"Billy Clanton","slug":"john-ireland"},{"actor":"Roy Roberts","role":"Mayor","slug":"roy-roberts"},{"actor":"Jane Darwell","role":"Kate Nelson","slug":"jane-darwell"},{"actor":"Grant Withers","role":"Ike Clanton","slug":"grant-withers"},{"actor":"J. Farrell MacDonald","role":"Mac","slug